 to your armor pieces to improve your skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Learn the attack patterns of strong enemies and bosses to defeat them with greater ease.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900790/extras/f92aa822bbe04105555ea83857441694.webp?t=1745960272\" width=616 height=27 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900790/extras/e79b066584c9a6ba526c664de92a1d97.avif?t=1745960272\" width=800 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much of the story will be up to the player to engage with or skip altogether. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Quests driven by the main story will contain a special marker </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Poking around books is a great way to learn hidden details </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900790/extras/86b2604076ef790ebe37ff6c7f34d7fb.webp?t=1745960272\" width=616 height=50 /></span>This game is a reimagining of an old Flash game I created back in 2010. For those curious about experiencing a piece of gaming history, the original can still be found online!</p>",
